SeafoamIslands_B2F_Text_Onybris3Intro::
    .string "The volcano is a fine hideout.\n"
    .string "Warm and no neighbors.$"

SeafoamIslands_B2F_Text_Onybris3Defeat::
    .string "I lost my composure…$"

SeafoamIslands_B2F_Text_Onybris3Post::
    .string "Take a gentleman's advice:\n"
    .string "do not go any deeper.$"

SeafoamIslands_B2F_Text_Onybris4Intro::
    .string "You smell like a lawman's kid!$"

SeafoamIslands_B2F_Text_Onybris4Defeat::
    .string "Hmph. Ugly loss.$"

SeafoamIslands_B2F_Text_Onybris4Post::
    .string "The boss walked right past us.\n"
    .string "We were told not to look.$"

SeafoamIslands_B2F_Text_BeatenGrunt::
    .string "A kid in a cap went through here.\n"
    .string "He wiped out my whole team…\p"
    .string "Go on. The cap kid is ahead,\n"
    .string "with a redhead.$"
